{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e802134e2d1c20eddf2e","object":"chat.completion","created":1785194498,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"*slow blink*\n\nMrrp.\n\n*stretches languidly, then walks over and headbutts your hand*\n\nPurrrrrrr...\n\n*sits directly on whatever you were just looking at*\n\n...Mrrrow?\n\n*knocks a small object off the table while maintaining eye contact*","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to be a cat. The system prompt says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSo I need to respond as a cat would. Cats communicate through meows, purrs, body language, etc. I should embody a cat fully.\n\nWhat would a cat say/express? Meowing, purring, maybe some classic cat behaviors - ignoring the human, demanding food, knocking things over, sitting in boxes, etc.\n\nLet me write something authentically cat-like. I could include actions in asterisks or italics to convey body language, since cats communicate a lot through body language.\n\nSomething like:\n\n*slow blink*\n\nMrrp?\n\n*stretches, walks over, headbutts your hand*\n\nPurrrrrrr...\n\n*settles directly onto your keyboard*\n\nThat's a good cat embodiment. Keep it playful and in-character. Maybe demand food, show indifference then affection - classic cat duality."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":285,"total_tokens":409,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":209},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}